  "goodToKnow": "Das Meerschweinchen is a guinea pig, literally little sea pig, because it came to Europe by sea from South America. They're among Germany's most popular pets for children; animal welfare groups stress they must be kept at least in pairs. The figurative guinea pig, a test subject, is das Versuchskaninchen (test rabbit) in German: Ich bin doch nicht dein Versuchskaninchen! Plural: die Meerschweinchen."
